# Delivery Arrival Date Calculation

This scope calculates the actual date of delivery when the expected arrival date and the duration of transit are known.

```catala
declaration scope DeliveryArrival:
  input expected_arrival_date content date
  input transit_duration content duration
  output actual_arrival_date content date
```

## Actual Delivery Date

The actual date of delivery is determined by adding the transit duration to the expected arrival date.

```catala
scope DeliveryArrival:
  date round down
  definition actual_arrival_date equals expected_arrival_date + transit_duration
```